---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Sidebar from "../components/Sidebar.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Nikhil Reddy" description="About Nikhil Reddy">
  <main id="main" role="main">
    <Sidebar />
    <article class="page">
      <div class="page__inner-wrap">
        <header><h1 class="page__title" itemprop="headline">about me</h1></header>
        <section class="page__content" itemprop="text">
          <p>I am a student at Stanford studying math with interests in markets and ML. I spent this summer on <a href="https://robinhood.com/us/en/prediction-markets/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Robinhood</a>'s Prediction Markets team and will be at <a href="https://www.evercore.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Evercore</a> next summer for M&amp;A.</p>
          <p>I love learning new things - currently spending time on computational linear algebra, deep learning, and real analysis. At Stanford, I was part of the <a href="https://kudlafund.stanford.edu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kudla Fund</a> and enjoy research.</p>
          <h1 id="pieces">repository</h1>
          <p>Take a look at what I have <a href="/reading">read</a> and some of my <a href="/writing">writings</a>. Let me know your thoughts!</p>
          <h1 id="miscellany">miscellany</h1>
          <p>I grew up in Texas and love the Dallas Mavericks, but was born in Cleveland, which provides me a compelling defense in case I ever need to switch teams to the Lakers (LeBron/Luka).</p>
          <p>In my free time, I enjoy playing pick-up basketball, reading, coding, clanking away on TypeRacer death mode, watching Christopher Nolan films, and binging <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Shark Tank</a>.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
